255
00:17:20,180 --> 00:17:22,240
Can you help me, kid? I'm stuck.

256
00:17:22,700 --> 00:17:24,818
Gotta get this sticky goo off of me.

257
00:17:28,980 --> 00:17:30,480
Here's your contract.

258
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:33,477
You will not do harm to any human.

259
00:17:33,560 --> 00:17:36,497
And you will follow all
orders from the family.

260
00:17:36,580 --> 00:17:42,117
I'm confused, and wait—what
happened to my body?

261
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,597
Changed me back.

262
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:45,717
Stop talking and get to work.

263
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:49,817
Okay, I can't talk.

264
00:17:49,900 --> 00:17:51,937
Why am I obeying this idiot?

265
00:17:52,020 --> 00:17:54,877
And you will follow all
orders from the family.

266
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:59,737
The contract—one more thing.

267
00:17:59,820 --> 00:18:01,037
Nobody remembers you.

268
00:18:01,120 --> 00:18:02,120
remembers you

269
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:05,900
Even I forgot who you were a second ago.

270
00:18:06,460 --> 00:18:08,397
Now you're going to work for Dofie until

271
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:11,240
you break down and we
have to throw you away.

272
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:15,200
How is this happening?

273
00:18:15,460 --> 00:18:17,240
I'm some kind of toy slave.

274
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:21,240
Keep walking straight till you
hit the port, then get to work.

275
00:18:23,320 --> 00:18:24,680
Oh, new guy.

276
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:26,377
I'll show you where to go.

277
00:18:26,460 --> 00:18:27,660
Is this a port?

278
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:29,780
Keep moving.

279
00:18:30,980 --> 00:18:32,860
Here, now get to work

280
00:18:35,900 --> 00:18:39,020
I'm a pirate, dammit What
kind of nightmare is this?

281
00:18:39,180 --> 00:18:40,415
And how do I wake up?

282
00:18:41,380 --> 00:18:42,677
There, your box.

283
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:43,680
Now go.

284
00:18:44,360 --> 00:18:46,357
No, these toys are creepy.

285
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,897
I don't want to be one of them.

286
00:18:47,980 --> 00:18:51,156
And I especially don't want
to slave away until I die.

287
00:18:54,420 --> 00:18:57,997
So this is where they trade the
weapons to the warring nations.

288
00:18:58,080 --> 00:18:59,860
But I'm powerless to stop it.

289
00:19:00,080 --> 00:19:01,380
I'm helping them.

290
00:19:01,980 --> 00:19:04,560
This is just the lead we were looking for.

291
00:19:04,800 --> 00:19:06,980
If only I had a transponder snail.

292
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:08,833
Koala's waiting for me.

293
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:11,412
There must be some way to regain control.

294
00:19:11,780 --> 00:19:13,360
Curse you, Doflamingo.

295
00:19:13,520 --> 00:19:14,991
I'm the king of protents.

296
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:17,360
Work as a toy till I break down?

297
00:19:17,580 --> 00:19:18,800
Is that a joke?

298
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:20,420
Somebody help me!

299
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:30,355
That must be Sugar talking to Trouble.

300
00:19:30,580 --> 00:19:32,820
She really is a kid. In appearance.

301
00:19:33,540 --> 00:19:35,720
Anyway, we know she loves grapes.

302
00:19:35,980 --> 00:19:37,451
She eats them constantly.

303
00:19:37,560 --> 00:19:38,800
And why do I care?

304
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:39,980
We have a plan.

305
00:19:40,580 --> 00:19:42,020
And a secret weapon!

306
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:46,660
Looks like a grape, but it's
a clump of Tata Babasco.

307
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:49,080
It's the hottest spice in the world!

308
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:52,675
Hold on, you're gonna make her eat it?

309
00:19:53,140 --> 00:19:55,552
We just have to sneak it into the basket.

310
00:19:55,980 --> 00:19:59,120
We tested it before on
50 people from our tribe.

311
00:19:59,420 --> 00:20:02,949
All of them were knocked out
cold and 18 of them almost died

312
00:20:05,740 --> 00:20:10,260
That sounds bad it better
be we can't take any risk

313
00:20:11,860 --> 00:20:13,517
Okay, Leo go.

314
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:15,424
I'll be watching you from here.

315
00:20:15,600 --> 00:20:20,440
I feel stronger already If this
goes south, I'm cutting out.

316
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:23,580
Good luck, Leo!

317
00:20:25,220 --> 00:20:27,100
Shut up! Are you crazy?

318
00:20:27,620 --> 00:20:29,500
Don't let Trouble notice you!

319
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:30,600
Be careful!

320
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:31,950
Hey!

321
00:20:32,033 --> 00:20:32,940
They're gonna kill you!

322
00:20:33,360 --> 00:20:34,780
This is just the start.

323
00:20:35,620 --> 00:20:37,680
Everyone, prepare yourselves.

324
00:20:38,300 --> 00:20:43,437
The moment that Sugar screams is the
moment when every toy in the kingdom.

325
00:20:43,520 --> 00:20:45,840
regains their human form at long last.

326
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:50,014
And the other citizens will
reclaim their lost memories.

327
00:20:50,560 --> 00:20:52,757
The truth of this land will be revealed.

328
00:20:52,840 --> 00:20:57,720
All of Doflamingo's evil will
be dragged out into the light!

329
00:20:58,220 --> 00:21:01,880
We will save our friends
and dress Rosa as well!

330
00:21:03,480 --> 00:21:04,960
I told you!

331
00:21:05,120 --> 00:21:06,180
You're too loud!

332
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:09,040
King Rick will claim
this kingdom once more!

333
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:12,460
Please shut up!

334
00:21:12,620 --> 00:21:14,420
They're gonna hear you!
